{"login": "JustGibas", "location": "Vilnius, Lithuania", "commits": [{"sha": "b0fb5814797e3335e8dee6918a5fe464677fa2f3", "message": "Update author meta, tweak MMO and HUD text\n\nAdded author meta tag to index.html. Changed initial WebSocket message from 'hello!' to 'Cat!'. Updated HUD text to 'Hunt continues!?' and added commented-out options for additional HUD messages. Minor code formatting improvements.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T13:08:40Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7eb9bcad76e243e9af5949ef3a526dccbeded6d1", "message": "Add timer display and improve pointer/audio handling\n\nIntroduces a timer display to the HUD, showing elapsed minutes and seconds. Improves pointer lock logic for XR and non-XR modes, ensures traps are cleared when resetting the cat, enhances cat catch logging with timestamps, and adds audio context cleanup and reinitialization when exiting XR sessions.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:41:53Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25fb240af5580c97ea20c79e019e899ca3e29149", "message": "Enhance terser config with detailed comments and 2nd pass option\n\nExpanded terser minification options with thorough inline documentation explaining each setting and its risks. Added an optional ultra-aggressive second minification pass, and improved output logging to include file size. Also updated HTML minifier options with commented suggestions for further optimization.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:09:23Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "beec87938f7bb3a05ab73ea32784cd916a1c0497", "message": "Create NOTICE.txt", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:03:12Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b4bc58e920efe1404f0cd135fd6e15e38812daf3", "message": "Adjust HUD hit text vertical position\n\nChanged the y-coordinate of the hit log text in the HUD from 140 to 160 for improved layout or visibility.", "created_at": "2025-09-14T12:02:14Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "96a70563e5cd4cf68e913566ddad079ef90c5a07", "message": "Merge branch 'FEATURE-Vr'", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:49:15Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9bbbed2717c824772969698b06a5ae90bcb9dd95", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:04:04Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "082930f4c844bc39313cd017d24abc19c54e6f22", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:03:55Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59e5e940eab782e559e2850df6deb352422edf05", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:38:33Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "565df11b832725ddc9d83d6672f4a98090714645", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2025-09-10T09:38:22Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e3e78d159f9b4677b102c29df4b1447db1ffe6a", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:26:48Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cfbfb8012a1d88fbf5cb1de9f3a4a45aa9412dda", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:26:48Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "29606617c08543b42ddf09567959d1eeec0bb369", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:26:48Z", "repo": "JS13kGame2025", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1898f61d